+- [License](#license)
+- [Support](#support)
+
+## Installation
+
+Install the package published for this repository:
+
+```bash
+nuget install Aspose.cells.Cpp.FOSS
+```
+
+The package was verified against NuGet for repository revision `3e1edeacd4c1600507009c3fd3bf122d54f5d3a9`.
+
 ## Highlights
 
